! LCLS-II post PAMM-6 (October 28-30, 2020) configuration

 !comment
  HXRCL    : LINE=(DGIRD01u,GIRD01,DBRSt,GIRD02,DBRSt,GIRD03,DBRL,GIRD04,DBRSt,GIRD05,DGIRD05d,HXCEL18,HXCEL19,HXCEL20,
